Description: isolated Remmina AVD and CAC prototype for EITaaS
 Private Remmina and FreeRDP build for protected Azure Virtual Desktop RDPW
 profiles, embedded Azure Government CAC authentication, and smart-card
 redirection. It does not replace distribution Remmina or FreeRDP.
